# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF in the repository,
# while leaving the working-tree files untouched. This stops git's
# autocrlf round-trip from reporting an entire file as changed when only a
# few lines differ (e.g. server.js showing a ~8500-line diff for a ~330-line
# change). Safe for all collaborators: it imposes no specific EOL on checkout.
* text=auto
